---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Competitive Analysis terms" description="Terms of use for the Competitive Analysis plugin." noindex={true}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-12">Competitive Analysis: terms</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:mb-6 prose-a:text-blue-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline">
      <p><em>Last updated October 29, 2026.</em></p>
      <p>
        Competitive Analysis is free, published by me, Aaron Roy, and its source is available under the MIT license at <a href="https://github.com/amr05008/competitive-analysis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/amr05008/competitive-analysis</a>.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6">What it is</h2>
      <p>
        A research method, carried out by the model in ChatGPT, Codex or Claude, plus a small server that looks up public records for it. The reports it produces are generated by the model from public web sources at the time you ask. They are a starting point for your own diligence, not a substitute for it.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6">What it is not</h2>
      <p>
        Not investment, legal, or financial advice. Not a guarantee that any claim is accurate, even one labeled VERIFIED: the label means the model read a primary source, and models misread. Check anything you intend to act on against the linked source.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6">The server</h2>
      <p>
        The plugin's four tools run on a server I pay for and run myself. It's free, it has daily limits, and it can be slow, rate-limited or unavailable; when it is, the teardown falls back to the app's own browsing. I may change the tools, limit them or shut the server down at any time. Its answers come from public sources at the moment you ask and can be incomplete or out of date, so the linked source is the record.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6">Your responsibilities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use it to research companies and products, not people.</li>
        <li>Respect the terms of any research plugin you connect, and of the sites the model visits on your behalf.</li>
        <li>Don't rely on it for decisions where being wrong is expensive without verifying first.</li>
        <li>Don't use the server for bulk collection or load testing, or to get around a source's limits.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6">Warranty and liability</h2>
      <p>
        Provided as is, without warranty of any kind. To the extent the law allows, I am not liable for any loss arising from its use. It may change or be withdrawn at any time.
      </p>
      <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:aaron@aaronroy.com?subject=Competitive%20Analysis%20plugin">aaron@aaronroy.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
